  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KENYA CONSERVATION POLICY LOCAL WORK PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">this programs objective is to expand the community conservancy model that focuses on enhancing localized efforts to address development and conservation challenges by shifting decision making, leadership and priority setting to communities and building the institutional capacity of locally led institutions. specifically, the program aims to empower the national advocacy body for conservancies and to provide an enabling policy framework, incentives, and support for conservancies from the government, non-governmental organizations, and the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
